.TH KUMNOTIFY 1 "2026" "kumde 0.8.0" "KumDE Manual"
.SH NAME
kumnotify \- notification daemon for KumDE
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kumnotify
.SH DESCRIPTION
kumnotify listens on a Unix datagram socket and pops up layer-shell
notification bubbles in the top-right corner of the output, stacked
and auto-dismissed after a timeout. Click a notification to dismiss
it immediately. Urgency level tints the accent color (low, normal,
critical).
.PP
Notifications are sent with
.BR kumde-msg (1)\'s
.B notify
subcommand, which writes to the socket directly \-\- there is no
D-Bus org.freedesktop.Notifications support.
.SH SOCKET
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/kumnotify.sock
.br
Wire format: \fBNOTIFY \fIapp\fB|\fIsummary\fB|\fIbody\fB|\fIurgency\fB|\fItimeout_ms\fR
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kumde (1),
.BR kumde-msg (1)
